## Development-mode question

We still need convenient local development and automated tests.

Propose a clean strategy for this.

Do not solve it by globally disabling security.

We should be able to have:

Production-like flow:
    real authentication
        ↓
    authenticated principal

and test/development support that is explicit and isolated.

If the existing `dev` profile can be retained safely for development,
explain exactly how.

Do not introduce machine-specific/local-only hacks.

Any required project behavior must work for another developer after cloning
the repository.

